##

00:00:00.067 --> 00:00:01.827 line:91%
There's nothing more I can do
to prepare for this.

00:00:01.827 --> 00:00:02.601 line:85%
<c.green>Then let's go for it.</c>

00:00:03.176 --> 00:00:04.693 line:85%
<i>(heavy sigh)</i> Okay.

00:00:05.702 --> 00:00:07.575 line:91%
Not convinced by
how shaky my hand is.

00:00:10.318 --> 00:00:12.171 line:91%
If all goes well,
in a few hours' time,

00:00:12.171 --> 00:00:14.023 line:85%
I am going to be tattooing someone.

00:00:14.023 --> 00:00:16.046 line:85%
This is Tash and Gaia.

00:00:16.046 --> 00:00:18.635 line:91%
<c.yellow>I'm Tash, Gaia.
We're from Lost Fox Tattoo.</c>

00:00:18.635 --> 00:00:21.350 line:91%
<c.yellow>And we're gonna be training Tom
for the next few hours.</c>

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:23.044 line:91%
Do I need to say,
"Don't try this at home"?

00:00:23.044 --> 00:00:27.001 position:66% line:91%
Because not only is it unsafe to do this
without all the facilities we've got here,

00:00:27.001 --> 00:00:30.496 position:66% line:91%
we had to go through legal, and insurance,
and permitting stuff, to do this.

00:00:30.496 --> 00:00:34.204 line:91%
If you don't have that support,
do not try this.

00:00:34.204 --> 00:00:35.959 line:85%
As for who I'm tattooing...

00:00:37.124 --> 00:00:38.828 line:91%
This is Han.
<c.green>Hi!</c>

00:00:38.828 --> 00:00:40.957 position:58% line:91%
You might recognise her from
the background of a couple of videos.

00:00:40.957 --> 00:00:42.920 line:91%
Han is on the production team
for this channel.

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:46.732 line:91%
<c.green>Yes, and this video was
entirely my idea!</c>

00:00:46.732 --> 00:00:48.660 line:85%
<c.green>I've got a few tattoos already,</c>

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:51.560 position:59% line:91%
<c.green>and I just thought it would be fun
to see if Tom can give me one as well.</c>

00:00:51.956 --> 00:00:54.830 line:91%
So, just to be clear,
don't do this.

00:00:54.830 --> 00:00:58.135 line:91%
And if any of us aren't comfortable
at any point here,

00:00:58.135 --> 00:00:59.662 line:85%
we won't be doing this.

00:00:59.662 --> 00:01:01.842 line:91%
With all that in mind,
should we try it?

00:01:01.842 --> 00:01:02.960 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yeah.</c>

00:01:07.049 --> 00:01:08.796 line:85%
So, hands washed.

00:01:08.796 --> 00:01:11.512 line:91%
I assume everything else here
is going to be sanitised first.

00:01:11.512 --> 00:01:12.871 line:91%
<c.yellow>Yes.  </c><c.cyan>  Yes.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Alright.</c>

00:01:12.871 --> 00:01:14.058 line:85%
<c.yellow>So, gloves on.</c>

00:01:14.058 --> 00:01:16.201 position:70% line:91%
Gloves on.
<c.yellow>Gloves on first. You've got yours down there.</c>

00:01:16.201 --> 00:01:17.290 line:85%
So...

00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:21.204 line:91%
I'm going obviously from zero to
hopefully tattooing in one day.

00:01:21.204 --> 00:01:22.768 line:85%
How long would this normally take?

00:01:22.768 --> 00:01:24.351 line:91%
<c.yellow>Depends on how brave
your friends are.</c>

00:01:24.351 --> 00:01:26.562 line:91%
That's— Right.
<c.yellow>You've got lots of willing friends</c>

00:01:26.562 --> 00:01:28.367 line:91%
<c.yellow>from early on that are like,
"You know what?</c>

00:01:28.367 --> 00:01:30.207 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yeah cool, you can give me one."</c>

00:01:30.207 --> 00:01:33.418 line:91%
<c.yellow>'Cause the sooner you start
on real skin...</c>

00:01:33.418 --> 00:01:35.590 line:85%
<c.yellow>...it kind of accelerates it.</c>

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:39.224 line:91%
So the quicker you get to
actual human skin, the better.

00:01:39.224 --> 00:01:41.475 line:91%
That sounds really weird
when I put it like that.

00:01:41.475 --> 00:01:44.317 line:76%
<c.yellow>When you stop, like, tattooing
the neighbourhood cats,</c>

00:01:44.317 --> 00:01:46.723 line:76%
<c.yellow>and you start tattooing humans,</c>
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(laughter)</i></c>

00:01:46.723 --> 00:01:49.782 line:76%
<c.yellow>that's when you start getting
really, really good, really fast.</c>

00:01:49.782 --> 00:01:52.043 line:85%
And this is synthetic skin then?

00:01:52.043 --> 00:01:54.058 line:91%
<c.yellow>Yeah.</c>
<c.cyan>Yeah, it feels really weird.</c>

00:01:54.058 --> 00:01:56.368 line:91%
Oh yeah, that's...
<c.yellow>It's weirdly skin-like, yeah.</c>

00:01:56.368 --> 00:01:57.094 line:85%
<c.yellow><i>(giggles)</i></c>

00:01:57.094 --> 00:01:58.571 line:85%
<c.cyan>If you look closely,</c>

00:01:58.571 --> 00:02:01.405 line:91%
<c.cyan>it should have kind of pores,
almost like real skin.</c>

00:02:01.732 --> 00:02:03.153 position:56% line:85%
<c.cyan>There's still a very big difference,</c>

00:02:03.153 --> 00:02:05.632 line:91%
<c.cyan>because it doesn't stretch in the
same way that real skin stretches.</c>

00:02:05.632 --> 00:02:08.035 line:91%
Right.
<c.cyan>But it's a good place to start.</c>

00:02:08.035 --> 00:02:09.129 line:91%
Okay.
<c.yellow>Mhm.</c>

00:02:09.129 --> 00:02:11.347 line:85%
<c.cyan>This is the machine.</c>

00:02:11.347 --> 00:02:12.918 line:91%
<c.cyan>It's a...</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Huh.</c>

00:02:12.918 --> 00:02:15.998 position:61% line:91%
<c.cyan>Like I said, it's a rotary machine,
so it's just got a little motor inside.</c>

00:02:15.998 --> 00:02:17.720 line:91%
<c.cyan>So this doesn't
look like your standard...</c>

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:19.201 line:91%
No, I was—
<c.cyan>...what you'd expect.</c>

00:02:19.201 --> 00:02:22.472 line:91%
I had a picture in my head of
what a tattoo gun looked like,

00:02:22.472 --> 00:02:24.054 line:85%
and that is not it.

00:02:24.054 --> 00:02:26.588 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah, this one is very streamlined.
This is called a pen style.</c>

00:02:26.588 --> 00:02:29.183 position:64% line:91%
<c.cyan>So you literally just hold it like a pen.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Hold it like a pen.</c>

00:02:29.183 --> 00:02:31.954 line:91%
<c.yellow>It's a far cry
from the sailor coils</c>

00:02:31.954 --> 00:02:34.492 line:91%
<c.yellow>that you used to have to
wind up with pound coins.</c>

00:02:34.492 --> 00:02:37.251 line:91%
For some reason, that scares me
a little bit more, because like,

00:02:37.251 --> 00:02:39.042 position:56% line:85%
"Oh, this is not a different thing."

00:02:39.042 --> 00:02:42.477 position:63% line:91%
I feel like I'm gonna be overconfident
if it's just like, "Hold it like a pen."

00:02:42.477 --> 00:02:45.650 line:91%
<c.yellow>Yeah, it's just a glorified pencil.
You'll be fine!</c>

00:02:45.650 --> 00:02:46.712 line:91%
<c.yellow><i>(giggles)</i></c>
<c.cyan><i>(chuckles)</i></c>

00:02:46.712 --> 00:02:50.340 position:56% line:91%
<c.cyan>So now, we're just wrapping the part
that you hold with some grip tape.</c>

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:53.683 line:85%
<c.cyan>This is just to help you grip it.</c>

00:02:53.683 --> 00:02:55.735 position:56% line:85%
<c.cyan>And it also just secures everything.</c>

00:02:55.735 --> 00:02:57.979 line:91%
<c.yellow>You are holding something
that is shaking,</c>

00:02:57.979 --> 00:03:01.839 position:78% line:91%
Yeah, it's a motor with an offset needle in there.
<c.yellow>and you're trying to do a very straight line.</c>

00:03:01.839 --> 00:03:05.064 line:85%
<c.yellow>So the grip tape sort of helps...</c>

00:03:05.064 --> 00:03:07.931 line:91%
<c.yellow>...swallow some of that vibration.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Alright. <i>(chuckles)</i></c>

00:03:07.931 --> 00:03:09.893 line:91%
Can I hold that?
<c.cyan>You can.</c>

00:03:09.893 --> 00:03:11.926 line:85%
My gloves are still safe, so...

00:03:12.426 --> 00:03:15.016 line:91%
So I've just kinda gone into
my normal pen hold there.

00:03:15.016 --> 00:03:17.511 line:91%
Is that right?
How do I need to hold this?

00:03:17.511 --> 00:03:19.714 line:91%
<c.cyan>The way that I usually
hold the machine</c>

00:03:19.714 --> 00:03:21.832 line:85%
<c.cyan>would be more like...</c>

00:03:22.645 --> 00:03:25.458 position:63% line:91%
<c.cyan>...kind of, you got a tighter grip on it
than you would a pen.</c>

00:03:25.458 --> 00:03:26.532 line:85%
Okay.

00:03:26.532 --> 00:03:31.150 line:91%
<c.cyan>And... making sure that you've got
a lot of... coverage on it,</c>

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:33.835 line:91%
<c.cyan>rather than just holding it
like a pencil like this.</c>

00:03:33.835 --> 00:03:37.320 line:91%
<c.yellow>When you're writing, a lot of
what you do comes from your wrist.</c>

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:40.621 line:91%
<c.yellow>But when you're tattooing,
it comes more from your elbow.</c>

00:03:40.621 --> 00:03:42.518 line:91%
Okay!
<c.yellow>Because it keeps it straighter.</c>

00:03:42.518 --> 00:03:44.533 line:91%
Then I think the—
<c.yellow>So if you hold it like a pencil,</c>

00:03:44.533 --> 00:03:47.278 line:91%
<c.yellow>the temptation is always there
to like, <i>(swishing)</i></c>

00:03:47.278 --> 00:03:48.631 line:91%
<c.yellow>Like this.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Oh yeah.</c>

00:03:48.631 --> 00:03:51.142 line:91%
<c.yellow>But when you're pushing,
it's better to have it like...</c>

00:03:51.142 --> 00:03:54.807 position:61% line:91%
So if I have two fingers there and
a knuckle wrapped in there, is that...?

00:03:54.807 --> 00:03:56.513 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yeah, I mean it's...</c>

00:03:56.513 --> 00:03:58.689 line:91%
<c.yellow>There's no hard-and-fast
rule, is there?</c>

00:03:58.689 --> 00:04:03.135 line:91%
<c.yellow>It is what feels—
makes you feel more confident.</c>

00:04:03.135 --> 00:04:04.934 line:91%
<c.cyan>More in control of everything.</c>
<c.yellow>In control.</c>

00:04:04.934 --> 00:04:06.468 line:91%
Alright.
<c.yellow>Exactly, exactly.</c>

00:04:06.468 --> 00:04:09.089 line:91%
<c.cyan>If you'll give the whole bed
a good spray.</c>

00:04:09.089 --> 00:04:10.001 line:85%
Alright.

00:04:14.467 --> 00:04:16.495 line:91%
Oh, I just got a massive
static shock off that!

00:04:16.495 --> 00:04:18.668 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah, that happens.</c>
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(both laugh)</i></c>

00:04:18.668 --> 00:04:21.905 line:91%
Obviously, a lot of tattoo artists
will work freehand, but...

00:04:21.905 --> 00:04:24.437 line:91%
...presumably you can
print out a design and then...

00:04:24.437 --> 00:04:26.601 line:91%
...follow the lines along
for someone like myself?

00:04:26.601 --> 00:04:29.757 line:91%
<c.yellow>Oh, it's actually pretty rare
that you would freehand.</c>

00:04:29.757 --> 00:04:34.055 line:91%
<c.yellow>I'd say in 99 percent of instances,
you would use a stencil.</c>

00:04:34.055 --> 00:04:35.262 line:85%
Okay.

00:04:35.262 --> 00:04:37.896 line:91%
<c.cyan>It'll be designs that you've
kind of drawn up beforehand,</c>

00:04:37.896 --> 00:04:39.501 line:91%
<c.cyan>And then people
will pick that design,</c>

00:04:39.501 --> 00:04:41.745 line:91%
<c.cyan>and then you'll just have it
printed out and ready to go.</c>

00:04:41.745 --> 00:04:43.731 line:91%
Okay. So we've got
everything cling-filmed.

00:04:43.731 --> 00:04:45.794 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>We've got the soap, towels,</c>

00:04:45.794 --> 00:04:49.199 line:91%
tattoo machine, ink...
anything we're missing?

00:04:49.199 --> 00:04:50.779 line:85%
<c.cyan>Nope, this is all you'll need.</c>

00:04:50.779 --> 00:04:53.327 line:91%
Alright, and a needle presumably.
<c.yellow>And you need a cartridge.</c>

00:04:53.327 --> 00:04:54.619 line:85%
<c.yellow><i>(giggles)</i> You need a needle!</c>

00:04:54.619 --> 00:04:56.602 line:91%
Needle in the cartridge.
<c.yellow>That would help.</c>

00:04:56.602 --> 00:04:57.957 line:91%
Alright.
<c.yellow>And so...</c>

00:04:57.957 --> 00:05:00.586 line:91%
I'm already nervous,
and this is artificial, fake skin!

00:05:00.586 --> 00:05:03.047 position:58% line:91%
This is just plastic.
<c.yellow>As soon as you do it, you'll realise,</c>

00:05:03.047 --> 00:05:05.235 position:64% line:91%
Okay, okay.
<c.yellow>"Okay, this is all right, I've got this."</c>

00:05:05.235 --> 00:05:07.624 line:91%
<c.cyan>We'll take them out of the casing
in a minute and have a look.</c>

00:05:07.624 --> 00:05:10.344 position:66% line:91%
<c.cyan>We can push the needle out
and see all the individual needles inside.</c>

00:05:10.344 --> 00:05:12.669 line:91%
'Cause right now, that just
looks like one thick needle.

00:05:12.669 --> 00:05:13.268 line:85%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:05:13.268 --> 00:05:16.577 line:91%
<c.cyan>So now, if you have a look,
we'll just push the needle up.</c>

00:05:16.577 --> 00:05:18.568 line:91%
<c.cyan>And you can see...</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Oh!</c>

00:05:18.568 --> 00:05:20.000 line:85%
I mean, I can't—

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:23.000 line:91%
I can just see,
at the very top, just a little—

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:24.765 position:59% line:91%
looks almost like it's a serrated edge
or something like that.

00:05:24.765 --> 00:05:26.868 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah. Yeah.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>So that's the individual needles.</c>

00:05:26.868 --> 00:05:29.547 line:91%
It has just kind of
sunk in for me...

00:05:29.547 --> 00:05:32.514 line:85%
...that this is like an actual...

00:05:32.514 --> 00:05:34.911 line:91%
...effectively a
medical treatment device.

00:05:34.911 --> 00:05:37.677 line:91%
Like, this is—
This is a really serious thing,

00:05:37.677 --> 00:05:41.841 position:61% line:91%
that if all goes well, I am going to be
piercing someone's skin with

00:05:41.841 --> 00:05:45.285 line:91%
in a few hours,
and that has just hit me!

00:05:45.285 --> 00:05:47.729 line:91%
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(others laughing)</i></c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>That's just arrived in my head!</c>

00:05:47.729 --> 00:05:49.537 line:91%
<c.cyan>Are you— Are you ready?</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Yeah.</c>

00:05:49.537 --> 00:05:51.045 line:91%
<c.green><i>(giggling)</i></c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>Yeah, sure, sure, okay.</c>

00:05:51.045 --> 00:05:53.269 line:91%
<c.cyan>So, grabbing the machine.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>So, pick up, make sure—</c>

00:05:53.269 --> 00:05:55.637 line:85%
Get in a decent grip.

00:05:55.637 --> 00:05:58.782 line:85%
Make sure I point it... <00:05:57.453><c>that way,</c>

00:05:58.782 --> 00:06:01.314 position:70% line:91%
so I'm facing— yeah, so I can see the needle.
It's coming out that way.

00:06:01.314 --> 00:06:03.312 line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE>And it's gonna be over here.</c>

00:06:03.312 --> 00:06:06.016 line:91%
And I'm just gonna try
and draw a line...

00:06:06.016 --> 00:06:07.135 line:85%
...that way.

00:06:07.135 --> 00:06:09.467 line:91%
<c.cyan>So you wanna dip into the ink
just a little bit.</c>

00:06:09.467 --> 00:06:12.544 position:72% line:91%
Okay.
<c.cyan>And you'll see it shoot up into the cartridge.</c>

00:06:16.458 --> 00:06:18.476 position:63% line:91%
Oh, yeah. That just fills the cartridge.
<c.cyan>See?</c>

00:06:18.476 --> 00:06:20.265 line:91%
Again, I don't know if that'll have
shown up on camera,

00:06:20.265 --> 00:06:22.713 line:91%
but it, like, bloomed up.
<c.cyan>Yeah.</c>

00:06:22.713 --> 00:06:24.493 line:91%
So that's now
loaded and ready to go?

00:06:24.493 --> 00:06:28.868 position:59% line:91%
<c.cyan>Yeah, so you wanna just give it
a gentle wipe on the paper you've got.</c>

00:06:30.645 --> 00:06:33.132 line:91%
<c.cyan>So that's just getting rid of
a little bit of excess.</c>

00:06:33.132 --> 00:06:35.260 line:85%
That's suddenly terrifying. Okay.

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:36.192 line:85%
<c.green><i>(snickering)</i></c>

00:06:36.192 --> 00:06:38.348 line:91%
<c.green>So then you wanna grab
a little bit of the Vaseline,</c>

00:06:38.348 --> 00:06:41.611 line:91%
<c.green>put it down onto the skin
with your little finger I'd say.</c>

00:06:41.611 --> 00:06:43.741 line:91%
Yep. I just need to
keep that away from me.

00:06:43.741 --> 00:06:44.573 line:85%
<c.green>Yep.</c>

00:06:45.237 --> 00:06:46.622 line:85%
So how deep?

00:06:46.622 --> 00:06:50.301 line:91%
<c.green>You wanna make contact, and then
you wanna go maybe a millimetre.</c>

00:06:50.301 --> 00:06:52.342 line:91%
Okay.
<c.green>Lower than that.</c>

00:06:57.288 --> 00:06:59.461 line:85%
Wow. That...

00:07:00.001 --> 00:07:02.163 line:85%
I expected more resistance.

00:07:02.163 --> 00:07:03.343 line:85%
<c.cyan>Mm...</c>

00:07:03.343 --> 00:07:05.748 line:91%
I expected much more
resistance to that.

00:07:06.653 --> 00:07:07.602 line:85%
<c.green>"Ow."</c>

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:11.595 line:91%
That... That felt like
it was too deep.

00:07:11.853 --> 00:07:14.113 position:58% line:91%
I— I felt, like, resistance off that.
<c.cyan>Was it the noise?</c>

00:07:14.113 --> 00:07:15.690 line:91%
Yeah.
<c.yellow>Sometimes the noise can be</c>

00:07:15.690 --> 00:07:17.548 line:85%
<c.yellow>a bit... scary at first.</c>

00:07:17.548 --> 00:07:20.557 line:91%
<c.yellow>But I don't actually think that
that did look very deep.</c>

00:07:20.557 --> 00:07:22.701 line:91%
<c.yellow>You might be moving
a bit too fast.</c>

00:07:22.701 --> 00:07:26.549 position:72% line:91%
<c.cyan>I also think the reason it's making that noise
is because you're not stretching it enough.</c>

00:07:26.549 --> 00:07:29.271 line:91%
<c.cyan>So what's happening is it's just
vibrating with the machine.</c>

00:07:29.271 --> 00:07:31.474 line:91%
Okay.
<c.yellow>And you're also going very fast.</c>

00:07:31.474 --> 00:07:32.404 line:85%
Okay!

00:07:32.404 --> 00:07:34.418 line:85%
<c.yellow>So it's sort of bouncing along,</c>

00:07:34.418 --> 00:07:37.530 line:91%
<c.yellow>because you're pulling so fast,
and the needle's, "b-b-b-b-b-boom".</c>

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:38.819 line:91%
Okay.
<c.yellow>Like this, yeah.</c>

00:07:41.728 --> 00:07:44.052 line:85%
<c.yellow>Wow, that was really good!</c>

00:07:44.052 --> 00:07:46.328 line:91%
Really? <i>(chuckles)</i>
<c.yellow>Yeah! <i>(giggles)</i></c>

00:07:46.328 --> 00:07:49.247 line:91%
<c.yellow>That was really, really good,
wasn't it?</c>

00:07:49.747 --> 00:07:52.867 line:91%
That felt... right.
I don't know why.

00:07:52.867 --> 00:07:53.704 line:85%
