00:25:32.135 --> 00:25:33.212 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yip.</c>

00:25:40.001 --> 00:25:42.046 line:85%
I think... I think that's it.

00:25:42.693 --> 00:25:44.118 line:91%
I think that's it!
<c.yellow><i>(anxious shiver)</i></c>

00:25:44.118 --> 00:25:45.582 line:85%
You know what?

00:25:46.163 --> 00:25:49.713 line:91%
I think that might be the best one
of the flowers that I've done.

00:25:49.713 --> 00:25:50.892 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yay!</c>

00:25:50.892 --> 00:25:53.132 position:56% line:85%
It's not perfect, not by a long way!

00:25:53.132 --> 00:25:55.175 line:91%
There's a little bit of wobble
here and there...

00:25:55.175 --> 00:25:58.640 line:91%
...but there's nothing in there
that I know you can't fix!

00:25:58.640 --> 00:25:59.523 line:85%
<c.yellow>Yeah!</c>

00:25:59.523 --> 00:26:01.685 line:91%
Han, do you wanna have
a quick look? There's the mirror...

00:26:02.374 --> 00:26:03.848 line:85%
<c.green>I'm really excited.</c>

00:26:04.834 --> 00:26:06.859 line:85%
<c.green><i>(gasp)</i> That looks so good!</c>

00:26:05.000 --> 00:26:11.000 align:start size:88% position:13% line:7%
<c.cyan><i>♪ (emotional acoustic music)</i></c>

00:26:06.859 --> 00:26:10.001 line:91%
<c.green>Like, genuinely so good!</c>
<c.colorEEEEEE><i>(chuckles)</i></c>

00:26:10.731 --> 00:26:13.986 position:58% line:91%
<c.green>Yeah, and they're...
Some of the lines are a bit squiggly.</c>

00:26:13.986 --> 00:26:16.177 line:85%
<c.green>But as a whole...</c>

00:26:16.177 --> 00:26:17.792 line:85%
<c.green>...that one whole-ass tattoo!</c>

00:26:18.068 --> 00:26:20.191 line:91%
Thank you, Han!
<c.green>It genuinely looks so cute.</c>

00:26:20.191 --> 00:26:22.630 line:85%
<c.green>I'm very, very chuffed.</c>

00:26:22.630 --> 00:26:23.892 line:85%
<c.green>Look at that!</c>

00:26:25.513 --> 00:26:27.354 line:91%
<c.yellow><i>(chuckling)</i></c>
<i>(exhausted laughing)</i>

00:26:27.354 --> 00:26:30.581 line:91%
<c.yellow>Well done! You did good!</c>
<c.colorCCCCCC><i>(group cheering)</i></c>

00:26:32.086 --> 00:26:33.998 line:85%
<c.green>That looks so good.</c>

00:26:34.714 --> 00:26:37.407 line:91%
You know what? Now I'm not
close-up to it, yeah it does.

00:26:37.407 --> 00:26:40.530 line:91%
Thank you, Han.
<c.green>Oh, you did so good!</c>

00:26:42.686 --> 00:26:44.200 line:85%
Little bit closer to me.

00:26:44.709 --> 00:26:46.554 line:85%
<c.green>I love it. Truly.</c>

00:26:47.831 --> 00:26:49.472 line:71%
It's two weeks later.

00:26:49.472 --> 00:26:51.908 position:58% line:71%
We are filming something else, and...

00:26:51.908 --> 00:26:53.991 position:59% line:76%
thought you might want a quick update.
How's it doing, Han?

00:26:53.991 --> 00:26:56.155 line:71%
<c.green>It is completely healed.</c>

00:26:56.155 --> 00:26:59.360 line:76%
<c.green>And it is looking as good
as it did when you did it.</c>

00:26:59.360 --> 00:27:01.920 position:61% line:71%
<c.green>I think that's often a good tell, is...</c>

00:27:01.920 --> 00:27:04.434 line:76%
<c.green>Do bits kind of fade
or peel off when it's healing?</c>

00:27:04.434 --> 00:27:06.616 line:71%
<c.green>Oh, no. It looks fantastic!</c>

00:27:06.616 --> 00:27:07.923 line:71%
Thank you!

00:27:07.923 --> 00:27:09.913 line:76%
That's such a relief.
Thank you, Han.

